{"meta":{"title":"فرض الفصل الأول في علوم الطبيعة والحياة (النموذج 2)","duration":"ساعة","term":1,"topics":["الامتصاص المعوي وبنية الزغابة","طريقا نقل المغذيات: الدموي واللمفاوي","التنفس الخلوي: المتفاعلات والنواتج","مقارنة الهواء المستنشق والمزفور"]},"paper":"\n<div class=\"ex\">\n<h2>التمرين الأول <span class=\"pts\">(10 نقاط)</span></h2>\n<p>قيس تركيز الغلوكوز في الدم الداخل إلى الأمعاء الدقيقة (الشريان) وفي الدم الخارج منها (الوريد البابي الكبدي) قبل الوجبة وبعدها:</p>\n<table class=\"grid\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>قبل الوجبة</th><th>بعد الوجبة بساعة</th></tr><tr><td>الشريان (g/L)</td><td>1</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>الوريد البابي (g/L)</td><td>1</td><td>2,5</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ol>\n<li>حلّل نتائج الجدول.</li>\n<li>ماذا تستنتج حول دور الأمعاء الدقيقة؟</li>\n<li>اذكر خاصيتين من خصائص الزغابة المعوية تجعلانها سطح امتصاص فعّال.</li>\n<li>ما طريق نقل الأحماض الدسمة بعد امتصاصها؟</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ex\">\n<h2>التمرين الثاني <span class=\"pts\">(10 نقاط)</span></h2>\n<p>تركيب الهواء المستنشق: <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21%</span></span></span></span></span> ، <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">03%</span></span></span></span></span>. تركيب الهواء المزفور: <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span> ، <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>قارن بين الهواءين.</li>\n<li>أين يُستهلك الأكسجين في الجسم؟ ولماذا؟</li>\n<li>اكتب المعادلة الإجمالية للتنفس الخلوي انطلاقًا من الغلوكوز.</li>\n<li>ما العلاقة بين التغذية والتنفس؟</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n","solution":"\n<div class=\"ex\"><h2>التمرين الأول</h2><table class=\"bareme\"><thead><tr><th>عناصر الإجابة</th><th>العلامة مجزأة</th><th>المجموع</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">1) قبل الوجبة التركيز متساوٍ (<span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>). بعد الوجبة يبقى ثابتًا في الشريان، ويرتفع في الوريد البابي إلى <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g/L</span></span></span></span></span></span>.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td><td class=\"t\" rowspan=\"4\">10</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">2) الأمعاء الدقيقة تمتص الغلوكوز الناتج عن الهضم وتمرره إلى الدم.</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">3) مساحة كبيرة بفضل الزغابات الكثيرة ، جدار رقيق (طبقة واحدة من الخلايا) ، غنية بالشعيرات الدموية واللمفاوية.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">4) الطريق اللمفاوي (الأوعية اللمفاوية)، ثم تصب في الدم.</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"ex\"><h2>التمرين الثاني</h2><table class=\"bareme\"><thead><tr><th>عناصر الإجابة</th><th>العلامة مجزأة</th><th>المجموع</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">1) الهواء المزفور أفقر بالأكسجين (<span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span></span></span></span></span> بدل <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21%</span></span></span></span></span>) وأغنى بثنائي أكسيد الكربون (<span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4%</span></span></span></span></span> بدل <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">03%</span></span></span></span></span>).</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td><td class=\"t\" rowspan=\"4\">10</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">2) في خلايا الجسم (على مستوى الميتوكوندري)، لأكسدة المغذيات وإنتاج الطاقة اللازمة لنشاطها.</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"3\">3) <span class=\"m\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span> + طاقة</p></td><td class=\"p\">3</td></tr><tr><td><p data-pts=\"2\">4) التغذية تزوّد الخلايا بالمغذيات (الغلوكوز)، والتنفس يؤكسدها بالأكسجين لإنتاج الطاقة؛ فهما وظيفتان متكاملتان.</p></td><td class=\"p\">2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n"}